# Keep the build context small and, more importantly, hermetic: host build
# outputs must never leak into a Linux image, or a "Linux passed" result could
# actually be a macOS artifact that rode along in the context.
#
# Patterns need an explicit `**/` to match below the context root -- a bare
# `*.node` matches only the top level, which is how a darwin-arm64 addon
# previously reached a linux/arm64 image from src/bindings/nodejs/ and was
# caught by scripts/verify-artifact.js finding two artifacts.
.git
.github
docs
assets

target
**/target
node_modules
**/node_modules
src/build
**/build
dist
**/dist
coverage
**/coverage
.napi
**/.napi

*.node
**/*.node
*.tgz
**/*.tgz
*.log
**/*.log
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store
